isible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"afc8a85bcbeec2feb4a0c08002eb90fe","RawContent":"I hear that straps rip pretty easily on the back,as you do have to get it very tight. If you get a dress, just make sure you have the tools to fix it on the day or before,in case it happes.","Attachments":[],"Id":666123,"PostDate":1240523964,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I hear that straps rip pretty easily on the back,as you do have to get it very tight. If you get a dress, just make sure you have the tools to fix it on the day or before,in case it happes.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"d@dmitrimarkine.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1239149520,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216553.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dmitri_Markine","Id":216553,"Name":"Dmitri_Markine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"142e1e62521927f984bfb304031165e1","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Jacilynda&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;oh here is your dress from her on the website: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.landybridal.com\/Product\/Pro2572.html\"&gt;wedding dress (HS8145)-wedding dress,prom gown and bridesmaid dress by landy bridal&lt;\/a&gt; Its about $236 in US dollars&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;EEEEEEKKKKK I found it on her site a lil bit ago and have been jumping off the walls with excitement!!! \n \n I came back on here to announce my good news and am excited to see your message, J. You ROCK, Jacilynda, thanks so much for searching for me!!! How the heck did you find it so fast?!?!","Attachments":[],"Id":666149,"PostDate":1240525598,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Jacilynda<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">oh here is your dress from her on the website: <a href='http:\/\/www.landybridal.com\/Product\/Pro2572.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>wedding dress (HS8145)-wedding dress,prom gown and bridesmaid dress by landy bridal<\/a> Its about $236 in US dollars<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>EEEEEEKKKKK I found it on her site a lil bit ago and have been jumping off the walls with excitement!!! <br \/> <br \/> I came back on here to announce my good news and am excited to see your message, J. You ROCK, Jacilynda, thanks so much for searching for me!!! How the heck did you find it so fast?!?!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"geminigem615@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1231200988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213622.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KimmyG","Id":213622,"Name":"KimmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e050a8b68863cd837bdd4ed1e90022f","RawContent":"ha I don&#039;t know. Her site is nice cause she actually categorizes things by the real designer so I just jumped to other and started looking!\n \n I ordered a standard size from her just because if you order a standard size you can return the dress. It meant alot to me to find someone confident enough in their work that they would do returns. Alot won&#039;t. You would just have to contact them, send the dress back w\/in 7 days. I think she charges a 30% restock fee, but i can&#039;t remember, I think she told me that if you need like a bigger size or something or order another dress they usually wave the restock fee.\n \n I was very concerned about my dress being flimsy and unable to really hold itself up, especially since my mamas are 34DD. But its fantastic. i bought bra cups to add in just to give the mamas a little lift but the dress does the rest, and I can&#039;t even zip it up all the way yet!!! I have to get rid of my big ass!","Attachments":[],"Id":666154,"PostDate":1240525880,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                ha I don't know. Her site is nice cause she actually categorizes things by the real designer so I just jumped to other and started looking!<br \/> <br \/> I ordered a standard size from her just because if you order a standard size you can return the dress. It meant alot to me to find someone confident enough in their work that they would do returns. Alot won't. You would just have to contact them, send the dress back w\/in 7 days. I think she charges a 30% restock fee, but i can't remember, I think she told me that if you need like a bigger size or something or order another dress they usually wave the restock fee.<br \/> <br \/> I was very concerned about my dress being flimsy and unable to really hold itself up, especially since my mamas are 34DD. But its fantastic. i bought bra cups to add in just to give the mamas a little lift but the dress does the rest, and I can't even zip it up all the way yet!!! I have to get rid of my big ass!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212460200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6407,"TotalPages":641,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":6400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
