\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Dee83<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">This is my TTD dress...I think it would look gorgeous in pictures<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/image.lightinthebox.com\/images\/v\/200903\/156922191849ba650d6c6e9.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> That is a cool dress!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>I have a fabulous photographer I can share in the United States Virgin Islands in late April\/early MayP.M. if interested!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/goppvbh7hxc5u.png\">http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/tick...pvbh7hxc5u.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cjmcdowell16@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1241916601,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217403.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":33,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CrystalM","Id":217403,"Name":"CrystalM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a19d93fdc5cab935c8f5c0af1351209d","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;pvbeachbride10&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I found a dress from Landy Bridal that I am thinking about ordering: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.landybridal.com\/Product\/Pro2654.html\"&gt;wedding dress (HS1583)-wedding dress,prom gown and bridesmaid dress by landy bridal&lt;\/a&gt;. I wish I knew who the original person was. Anyways, it&#039;s so pretty!\n \n This thread is awesome!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I searched and could not figure it out, so I emailed her to see who the original designer is. Some other people asked on the site but she had not answered. She told me its an old Linea Raffaelli. I couldn&#039;t find pics so it must discontinued. I hadn&#039;t heard of this designer, but thats probably cause the dresses arent sold in the US. But I looked up the designers site and the dresses are AMAZING!","Attachments":[],"Id":700356,"PostDate":1243064632,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>pvbeachbride10<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I found a dress from Landy Bridal that I am thinking about ordering: <a href='http:\/\/www.landybridal.com\/Product\/Pro2654.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>wedding dress (HS1583)-wedding dress,prom gown and bridesmaid dress by landy bridal<\/a>. I wish I knew who the original person was. Anyways, it's so pretty!<br \/> <br \/> This thread is awesome!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I searched and could not figure it out, so I emailed her to see who the original designer is. Some other people asked on the site but she had not answered. She told me its an old Linea Raffaelli. I couldn't find pics so it must discontinued. I hadn't heard of this designer, but thats probably cause the dresses arent sold in the US. But I looked up the designers site and the dresses are AMAZING!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212460200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","Phot