nal link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t41443<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212460200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c0cda0b515c2e6b45d5c4afd66304f5","RawContent":"Thanks Jacilynda! I think I may go with the standard sizing, only because I saw that she doesn&#039;t accept returns on custom orders.","Attachments":[],"Id":729951,"PostDate":1245423117,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Jacilynda! I think I may go with the standard sizing, only because I saw that she doesn't accept returns on custom orders.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1190013.png\">http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1190013.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rch1228@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1236716424,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215675.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"blushingbride","Id":215675,"Name":"blushingbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3623a2655812d8692ff8d67ab085c225","RawContent":"thats what i did was standard sizing, her measurements on her table are RIGHt on! But now that i&#039;ve seen and felt her work i highly recommend her and would encourage custom measurements, unless you&#039;re really close in measurements to one of her standard sizes","Attachments":[],"Id":729992,"PostDate":1245424277,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                thats what i did was standard sizing, her measurements on her table are RIGHt on! But now that i've seen and felt her work i highly recommend her and would encourage custom measurements, unless you're really close in measurements to one of her standard sizes\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212460200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a59d31d20b78d7c24adf11a6916aaae5","RawContent":"For those of you who ordered online, did you try the dress on in a store first to determine what style you liked, or did you just &amp;quot;go with your gut&amp;quot;?","Attachments":[],"Id":730333,"PostDate":1245440320,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                For those of you who ordered online, did you try the dress on in a store first to determine what style you liked, or did you just \"go with your gut\"?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;24\/st\/20100109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/af33\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...af33\/event.png<\/a><br><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i27.photobucket.com\/albums\/c171\/vandygurl06\/IMG_1116-2.jpg\">http:\/\/i27.photobucket.com\/albums\/c1...IMG_1116-2.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lbrewer2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1243017085,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217747.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NYCBridetoBe1909","Id":217747,"Name":"NYCBridetoBe1909","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4def10a810d9256b784c8d64c1b993fb","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;lexibride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Wow guys!! This is just the thread I was looking for. The dress I love is $2200 and I really don&#039;t want to spend that kind of money on that. I&#039;d rather spend the $2000 on my family&#039;s travel expenses or something else!! I did find an ebay seller that does replicas and their feedback is great! AND they have the Jim Hjelm dress I&#039;m looking to buy &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile29\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/cgi.ebay.com.au\/ws\/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;amp;ssPageName=STRK:MEWAX:IT&amp;amp;item=350208499743#ebayphotohosting\"&gt;V-Neck Mermaid Laceowork WEDDING Dress BRIDAL GOWNS NWT - eBay, Wedding Dresses, Wedding Apparel Accessories, Clothing, Shoes Accessories. (end time 30-Jun-09 16:47:22 AEST)&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n I would rather though get it from someone that you guys have used. Maybe I&#039;ll give Landy a shot and see if they can make it. What would I do without you guys&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I also love the 8800 Jim Hjelm dress. Jacilyn does your place have this dress? I would buy it today!!!!!!!!!!!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":730397,"PostDate":1245443391,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>lexibride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Wow guys!! This is just the thread I was looking for. The dress I love is $2200 and I really don't want to spend that kind of money on that. I'd rather spend the $2000 on my family's travel expenses or something else!! I did find an ebay seller that does replicas and their feedback is great! AND they have the Jim Hjelm dress I'm looking to buy <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile29\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/cgi.ebay.com.au\/ws\/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&ssPageName=STRK:MEWAX:IT&item=350208499743#ebayphotohosting' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>V-Neck Mermaid Laceowork WEDDING Dress BRIDAL GOWNS NWT - eBay, Wedding Dresses, Wedding Apparel Accessories, Clothing, Shoes Accessories. (end time 30-Jun-09 16:47:22 AEST)<\/a><br \/> <br \/> I would rather though get it from someone that you guys have used. Maybe I'll give Landy a shot and see if they can make it. What would I do without you guys<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I also love the 8800 Jim Hjelm dress. Jacilyn does your place have this dress? I would buy it today!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"LucieVital@Yahoo.Com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1244490418,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218241.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":73,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Seven","Id":218241,"Name":"Seven","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06420b8b13fe6c81c3f910858ecc72d5","RawContent":"i tried looking and couldn&#039;t find it, but if you want you can email her and see if she can make it! her email is: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:asapbay@yahoo.com\"&gt;asapbay@yahoo.com&lt;\/a&gt; her name is roselyn. they off course are on a different time zone but she usually gets on in a few hours from now!\n \n NYC bride- i tried on dresses before and new what i was wanting.landy doesn&#039;t have my dress on their site. I emailed her and asked if she could make it and she said ya!","Attachments":[],"Id":730428,"PostDate":1245444991,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i tried looking and couldn't find it, but if you want you can email her and see if she can make it! her email is: <a href='mailto:asapbay@yahoo.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>asapbay@yahoo.com<\/a> her name is roselyn. they off course are on a different time zone but she usually gets on in a few hours from now!<br \/> <br \/> NYC bride- i tried on dresses before and new what i was wanting.landy doesn't have my dress on their site. I emailed her and asked if she could make it and she said ya!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212460200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"da0855350fc08f02404303c1348a0ea9","RawContent":"I found the La Sposa Madeira dress I want - she has it up for auction on ebay as well as on her site. I emailed her and she wrote back saying that the dress will be the same as in the picture, but the only differences will be in the lace and appliques used because they can&#039;t clearly see the photos. I must admit, at first I was nervous about what the dress was going to look like, but she said it will look like the dress in the picture.","Attachments":[],"Id":730773,"PostDate":1245468986,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I found the La Sposa Madeira dress I want - she has it up for auction on ebay as well as on her site. I emailed her and she wrote back saying that the dress will be the same as in the picture, but the only differences will be in the lace and appliques used because they can't clearly see the photos. I must admit, at first I was nervous about what the dress was going to look like, but she said it will look like the dress in the picture.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1190013.png\">http:\/\/tac.families.com\/ezb\/1190013.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rch1228@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1236716424,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215675.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"blushingbride","Id":215675,"Name":"blushingbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ba3f14aa267a8e359dc824cab90ac5c","RawContent":"I was REALLY nervous and funny thing she sent the dress and i pulled it out and it didn&#039;t have any of the pleating. I was doing everything i could not to freak out and break down in tears!!! then I realized she flipped the dress inside out for shipping!","Attachments":[],"Id":730801,"PostDate":1245471204,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I was REALLY nervous and funny thing she sent the dress and i pulled it out and it didn't have any of the pleating. I was doing everything i could not to freak out and break down in tears!!! then I realized she flipped the dress inside out for shipping!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212460200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4bf7dc069b11cc19bbd2afbdc33867a","RawContent":"Okay, I&#039;ve been chewing this over for a while but I think I&#039;m going to go for it!!\n Told Duosheng to send me the PayPal request and we&#039;ll make it happen, ahhh!!\n \n I&#039;m going with Binefar by San Patrick, here it is on Duosheng&#039;s website: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/CHIC-171.html\"&gt;\u0160\u00b1\u008f\u2014\u00ae\u02c6\u00a8\u008d\u00be\u00b5\u201e\u0160\u00b1\u2030\u0090\u2020\u00b7\u2026\u2020\u00b7\u00be\u0160\u017d&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n They have been great responding to emails, answering questions, adhering requests, etc. I&#039;m excited to get this ball rolling!!! \n Thanks, Jacilynda- Member of the Month- for all the encouragement!!","Attachments":[],"Id":731632,"PostDate":1245618419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Okay, I've been chewing this over for a while but I think I'm going to go for it!!<br \/> Told Duosheng to send me the PayPal request and we'll make it happen, ahhh!!<br \/> <br \/> I'm going with Binefar by San Patrick, here it is on Duosheng's website: <a href='http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/CHIC-171.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>\u0160\u00b1\u008f\u2014\u00ae\u02c6\u00a8\u008d\u00be\u00b5\u201e\u0160\u00b1\u2030\u0090\u2020\u00b7\u2026\u2020\u00b7\u00be\u0160\u017d<\/a><br \/> <br \/> They have been great responding to emails, answering questions, adhering requests, etc. I'm excited to get this ball rolling!!! <br \/> Thanks, Jacilynda- Member of the Month- for all the encouragement!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"geminigem615@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1231200988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213622.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KimmyG","Id":213622,"Name":"KimmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5dd1295a344e2dba4d0f72b7637874d1","RawContent":"No problem!!!! I know you LOVE this dress so i can&#039;t wait to hear how it turns out! And of course you are &amp;quot;required&amp;quot; to post pics!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":731864,"PostDate":1245634735,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                No problem!!!! I know you LOVE this dress so i can't wait to hear how it turns out! And of course you are \"required\" to post pics!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-l