2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;KJT1985&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;No but here&#039;s a currency converter I use all the time. \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.xe.com\/ucc\/\"&gt;XE - Universal Currency Converter&lt;\/a&gt;\n Just plug in the value and make sure the &amp;quot;from&amp;quot; &amp;quot;to&amp;quot; is what you want. Even though they&#039;re in China they show prices as euros.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks! So i should do China?","Attachments":[],"Id":868377,"PostDate":1254444749,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>KJT1985<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">No but here's a currency converter I use all the time. <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.xe.com\/ucc\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>XE - Universal Currency Converter<\/a><br \/> Just plug in the value and make sure the \"from\" \"to\" is what you want. Even though they're in China they show prices as euros.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks! So i should do China?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nij2002@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1241752417,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217368.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Peachy~Girl","Id":217368,"Name":"Peachy~Girl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22233db8768fcb1de6764208836a507b","RawContent":"love the idea of saving money, but how do you try it on?","Attachments":[],"Id":868386,"PostDate":1254445136,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                love the idea of saving money, but how do you try it on?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>Akumal, Mexico 05.29.10<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jasinandnicole@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1253387582,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221799.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nicitica","Id":221799,"Name":"nicitica","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d8590d7ff9bf876af8f4d8c3e821d903","RawContent":"You can&#039;t try it on. You basically have to trust their sizes (which seems to have worked out ok for most brides) or get a custom size which can&#039;t go too wrong. \n \n For the currency - I did euros to US dollars.","Attachments":[],"Id":868449,"PostDate":1254447110,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You can't try it on. You basically have to trust their sizes (which seems to have worked out ok for most brides) or get a custom size which can't go too wrong. <br \/> <br \/> For the currency - I did euros to US dollars.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10748;0\/st\/20100223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/67d5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...67d5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"katie.torley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1232061403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213991.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KJT1985","Id":213991,"Name":"KJT1985","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"10899eb9fa564351d8a6e2d6ca611bf1","RawContent":"Hey ladies. I just ordered a dress from a designer in China. It is a bridesmaid dress. It looks just like the picture and is made extremely well! The only trouble is...I&#039;m not sure that I like the dress in the color that I chose. Luckily they have a return policy. I was aprehensive about ordering a dress from China but after seeing how close the real thing is to the picture and awesome quality of the dress, I am going to order my wedding dress from one! If I can figure out how to post pictures I will....","Attachments":[],"Id":869622,"PostDate":1254533326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey ladies. I just ordered a dress from a designer in China. It is a bridesmaid dress. It looks just like the picture and is made extremely well! The only trouble is...I'm not sure that I like the dress in the color that I chose. Luckily they have a return policy. I was aprehensive about ordering a dress from China but after seeing how close the real thing is to the picture and awesome quality of the dress, I am going to order my wedding dress from one! If I can figure out how to post pictures I will....\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Loving married life! <3<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ldhearne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1249413540,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220176.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*Linds*","Id":220176,"Name":"*Linds*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46b0c82831a8a2ca841f8ed45f1308df","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Sapphire723&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;In addition to the question of quality, I feel that it&#039;s a bit of a question of ethics. Part of the reason that designer dresses are so expensive is because someone takes a lot of time and effort to come up with an original and beautiful design. The knock-offs are cheaper because they don&#039;t have to waste time designing anything if they can just steal someone else&#039;s design. \n \n It&#039;s also semi-illegal to buy knockoffs. I say semi, because some of the designs are not unique enough for trade dress laws to apply, plus they usually don&#039;t prosecute consumers in the US, especially if you only own one knockoff.\n \n Better off buying an original at a sample sale, imo.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;ITA with everything you said...\n \n Honestly this forum should probably take a standpoint on fakes\/counterfeit items and disallow posting of links to websites that sell fakes.","Attachments":[],"Id":870706,"PostDate":1254689203,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Sapphire723<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">In addition to the question of quality, I feel that it's a bit of a question of ethics. Part of the reason that designer dresses are so expensive is because someone takes a lot of time and effort to come up with an original and beautiful design. The knock-offs are cheaper because they don't have to waste time designing anything if they can just steal someone else's design. <br \/> <br \/> It's also semi-illegal to buy knockoffs. I say semi, because some of the designs are not unique enough for trade dress laws to apply, plus they usually don't prosecute consumers in the US, especially if you only own one knockoff.<br \/> <br \/> Better off buying an original at a sample sale, imo.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>ITA with everything you said...<br \/> <br \/> Honestly this forum should probably take a standpoint on fakes\/counterfeit items and disallow posting of links to websites that sell fakes.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>*******************************<\/span><br><br><span>-Katie<\/span><br><span>Have you met <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.alice.com\/referral\/13B20150\">Alice<\/a><span>?<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wOtHeXf\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...eXf\/weight.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"khargraves@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.63.215.115","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1245873240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218765.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"finzup","Id":218765,"Name":"finzup","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e320f9fe60947cb70f1af54045546202","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;KJT1985&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Has anybody bought a dress with intricate beading? This is the only part i&#039;m slightly worried about....I don&#039;t mind if it&#039;s not exact I just don&#039;t want it really far off so that it&#039;s not even the same effect. Thanks guys!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Yep - I ordered &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?line=d&amp;amp;style=SD5204\"&gt;this one&lt;\/a&gt; from &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/fen\/index1.html\"&gt;Duosheng&lt;\/a&gt; the whole bodice is beaded and I am excited\/freaking out as it arrives this month. I will post pics once I have it.","Attachments":[],"Id":872290,"PostDate":1254776726,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>KJT1985<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Has anybody bought a dress with intricate beading? This is the only part i'm slightly worried about....I don't mind if it's not exact I just don't want it really far off so that it's not even the same effect. Thanks guys!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Yep - I ordered <a href='http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?line=d&style=SD5204' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>this one<\/a> from <a href='http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/fen\/index1.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Duos