{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"17f5cecff736d76413c0abb4b3f6cb94","RawContent":"This is great! Fantastic links and this is really making it seem more like something that would turn out great rather than horrible.\n \n Has anyone ordered from oliviabridal.com or heard anything about them? They seems to do some of the more upscale dresses.\n \n Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":879657,"PostDate":1255199940,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is great! Fantastic links and this is really making it seem more like something that would turn out great rather than horrible.<br \/> <br \/> Has anyone ordered from oliviabridal.com or heard anything about them? They seems to do some of the more upscale dresses.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"fallen_666@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1254683887,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222293.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mlabbe","Id":222293,"Name":"mlabbe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"48e3f4aa26a98fda573a47dc8486e43d","RawContent":"Hello ladies! \n \n I live in Shanghai, China and I did all my dress shopping in the U.S. I took lots of pictures and found &amp;quot;the dress&amp;quot; It was $375 in the U.S. but I brought the pictures back with me to China and had the dress made in 2 weeks and it exceeded my expectations. Not to mention it was only $70 USD!!!! If I get a chance, I will post the pictures of me in the U.S. with my $375 dress compared to the pictures in my $70 China dress. My dress had silk, satin and chiffon along with beading and a corset back! I LOVE IT!!!! \n \n I think if you have a good tailor they can do a great job. We&#039;ve lived here a year and I&#039;ve had lots of clothing made very cheap and good quality! I don&#039;t know what I&#039;ll do when I have to move back to the U.S. and have to pay full price for everything &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n Good Luck girls!\n \n ~ Erica","Attachments":[],"Id":880366,"PostDate":1255305902,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello ladies! <br \/> <br \/> I live in Shanghai, China and I did all my dress shopping in the U.S. I took lots of pictures and found \"the dress\" It was $375 in the U.S. but I brought the pictures back with me to China and had the dress made in 2 weeks and it exceeded my expectations. Not to mention it was only $70 USD!!!! If I get a chance, I will post the pictures of me in the U.S. with my $375 dress compared to the pictures in my $70 China dress. My dress had silk, satin and chiffon along with beading and a corset back! I LOVE IT!!!! <br \/> <br \/> I think if you have a good tailor they can do a great job. We've lived here a year and I've had lots of clothing made very cheap and good quality! I don't know what I'll do when I have to move back to the U.S. and have to pay full price for everything <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Good Luck girls!<br \/> <br \/> ~ Erica\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"houghtoe@shapecorp.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1250685015,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220709.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meyer2010","Id":220709,"Name":"Meyer2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ae93eaa8e17ec25483ac4c2d423b437","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;mlabbe&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;This is great! Fantastic links and this is really making it seem more like something that would turn out great rather than horrible.\n \n Has anyone ordered from oliviabridal.com or heard anything about them? They seems to do some of the more upscale dresses.\n \n Thanks!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;This place looks awesome!!! For a TTD it&#039;s not too practical as it&#039;s on the expensive side. I&#039;d try it for my wedding dress that&#039;s for sure :)","Attachments":[],"Id":880940,"PostDate":1255360661,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>mlabbe<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">This is great! Fantastic links and this is really making it seem more like something that would turn out great rather than horrible.<br \/> <br \/> Has anyone ordered from oliviabridal.com or heard anything about them? They seems to do some of the more upscale dresses.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>This place looks awesome!!! For a TTD it's not too practical as it's on the expensive side. I'd try it for my wedding dress that's for sure <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>~ Mmm cupcakes ~<\/span><br \/>\n<span>[url=<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/%5D\">http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/]<\/a><br \/>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;2\/st\/20100919\/e\/Our+Italian+Family+Recept\/dt\/-3\/k\/79dd\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...79dd\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"johnnygirl777@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1219259160,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211300.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KittenHeart","Id":211300,"Name":"KittenHeart","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b871f9d31b5374edfd35802dcb86dc8","RawContent":"Sooo mad! I have the day off to take my dog to the vet, and I thought great my dress is suppose to arrive today. It comes 10 minutes before I get back! Now I have to wait till tomorrow &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":880952,"PostDate":1255361018,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n             