{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a2f9e2e60cfd572ee51cfcf2e857417","RawContent":"Island Princess...they really did a great job on your dress!!! Also...you look gorgeous in it....I like the mermaid style on you.","Attachments":[],"Id":884166,"PostDate":1255526344,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Island Princess...they really did a great job on your dress!!! Also...you look gorgeous in it....I like the mermaid style on you.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"classadiva@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1252270204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221365.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"classadiva","Id":221365,"Name":"classadiva","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd3460f81e904077afc908d2e48c43b5","RawContent":"The material is defintely different. The sash thing in the middle was satin, and the rest was lace. This is all the same material. There is beading on it, you cant really tell in the pictures though. \n \n I dont know. Im getting more upset looking at the pictures. I just dont like the way it photographs. I should of picked a more simple design, its my own fault. Dont get me wrong the customer service was excellent, and they got it to me in 2.5 weeks. The quality is even better than I expected. Its just not doing it for me, and its a huge let down. Im trying not to focus on that and remember what the wedding is about, but its still disappointing.","Attachments":[],"Id":884208,"PostDate":1255528400,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The material is defintely different. The sash thing in the middle was satin, and the rest was lace. This is all the same material. There is beading on it, you cant really tell in the pictures though. <br \/> <br \/> I dont know. Im getting more upset looking at the pictures. I just dont like the way it photographs. I should of picked a more simple design, its my own fault. Dont get me wrong the customer service was excellent, and they got it to me in 2.5 weeks. The quality is even better than I expected. Its just not doing it for me, and its a huge let down. Im trying not to focus on that and remember what the wedding is about, but its still disappointing.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cajaya@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1210010430,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209276.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SgtPepperette","Id":209276,"Name":"SgtPepperette","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d6b34155c8376c1e88f4fa95bd22fde8","RawContent":"I just received a quote from Lancy and my dream dress would be $545. I am thinking that it is still a lot of money. But Island Princess, SgtPepperetteall, and Jacilynda all look so wonderful in the dresses I just don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t know what to do.","Attachments":[],"Id":884214,"PostDate":1255528844,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just received a quote from Lancy and my dream dress would be $545. I am thinking that it is still a lot of money. But Island Princess, SgtPepperetteall, and Jacilynda all look so wonderful in the dresses I just don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t know what to do.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"TinaCU1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1255048144,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222474.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TheOneDay","Id":222474,"Name":"TheOneDay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":nul