 inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>blumenthale<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Wow, both dresses look great. I especially love the Jim Hjelm design. <br \/> Island Bride- Did you send that design to Landy bridal or did they have that on their website?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Heya,<br \/> <br \/> I emailed the above picture and then I added instructions on the neckline. I included similar necklines in pictures so they knew what I was talking about!<br \/> <br \/> You can pretty much email them any photo and they will do the best they can <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i45.tinypic.com\/111l7xk.jpg\">http:\/\/i45.tinypic.com\/111l7xk.jpg<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;131\/st\/20100510\/e\/Our+Hawaiian+Wedding\/dt\/15\/k\/ae98\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...ae98\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"christie_bielaczek@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1218889923,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211218.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Island Princess","Id":211218,"Name":"Island Princess","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06d8acf556507aa836c9a99a71c68690","RawContent":"Island Princess - Love the dress and the deep sweetheart looks great :)\n \n I&#039;m so convinced... Now i&#039;ve just gotta narrown it down form the 50 or so dresses that I&#039;m in love with :)","Attachments":[],"Id":885162,"PostDate":1255558097,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Island Princess - Love the dress and the deep sweetheart looks great <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> I'm so convinced... Now i've just gotta narrown it down form the 50 or so dresses that I'm in love with <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.olma@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1249340110,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220135.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":172,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jo 2010","Id":220135,"Name":"Jo 2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b46b7bf0bde2d7a507b489c1764305df","RawContent":"WOW!!!!\n \n Melissa- Its definitely a different overlay, but of course we can&#039;t get exact. First of all aside from the overlay I think you look FANTASTIC in this dress... it is SOOOOOO Slimming on you! I see what you are saying about the pictures and you&#039;re worried about photography. Are you getting married outside? I was thinking you were and it will be so much different outside in the sun and if you&#039;re doing it in the sand and the ocean as a backdrop I don&#039;t think you&#039;ll notice it as much. Try going outside and taking pics and see how daylight treats it!\n \n Christie!!!!!!!!!!!! I LOVE this dress on you!!!! You look fantastic and I&#039;m so excited about how well they&#039;ve done on the lace! \n \n Kimmy- You do not look frumpy at all! But i think if you have alterations done you&#039;ll be so happy!\n \n I have a friend of a friend who ordered her dress and BM dresses from Landy and just got them the other day. I&#039;ll email her and see if she could get some pics that I could share!","Attachments":[],"Id":885164,"PostDate":1255558156,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                WOW!!!!<br \/> <br \/> Melissa- Its definitely a different overlay, but of course we can't get exact. First of all aside from the overlay I think you look FANTASTIC in this dress... it is SOOOOOO Slimming on you! I see what you are saying about the pictures and you're worried about photography. Are you getting married outside? I was thinking you were and it will be so much different outside in the sun and if you're doing it in the sand and the ocean as a backdrop I don't think you'll notice it as much. Try going outside and taking pics and see how daylight treats it!<br \/> <br \/> Christie!!!!!!!!!!!! I LOVE this dress on you!!!! You look fantastic and I'm so excited about how well they've done on the lace! <br \/> <br \/> Kimmy- You do not look frumpy at all! But i think if you have alterations done you'll be so happy!<br \/> <br \/> I have a friend of a friend who ordered her dress and BM dresses from Landy and just got them the other day. I'll email her and see if she could get some pics that I could share!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212460200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false