dBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a5b5e843128b5a4b4056ead24d5d2041","RawContent":"Hi Ladies, I am sending out a package to my guest just before the wedding. Its a travel survival kit. (It will be about 18 hours of travel!) I got cute bags for each couple and stuffed the following in them:\n 1 pkg wet wipes\n 2 pr. socks\n 2 toothpaste coated disposable toothbrushes\n 2 sleeping mask\n 1 barf bag\n 1 mini size Dramamine (looking for that)\n 1 mini size advil (hoping i can find that here) \n 1 small puzzle book (havent found yet)\n I have these cute tags that I want to stick our monogram on and write something like &amp;quot;Here&#039;s your travel survival kit. Have a safe trip. See you in Fiji! - Love, Charonda &amp;amp; Von&amp;quot; (something like that) \n \n I want to find some cute ribbon.. must be real cheap and not in bulk. Any suggestions&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n Colors: Aqua Melon Hot Pink","Attachments":[],"Id":172286,"PostDate":1200769634,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Ladies, I am sending out a package to my guest just before the wedding. Its a travel survival kit. (It will be about 18 hours of travel!) I got cute bags for each couple and stuffed the following in them:<br \/> 1 pkg wet wipes<br \/> 2 pr. socks<br \/> 2 toothpaste coated disposable toothbrushes<br \/> 2 sleeping mask<br \/> 1 barf bag<br \/> 1 mini size Dramamine (looking for that)<br \/> 1 mini size advil (hoping i can find that here) <br \/> 1 small puzzle book (havent found yet)<br \/> I have these cute tags that I want to stick our monogram on and write something like \"Here's your travel survival kit. Have a safe trip. See you in Fiji! - Love, Charonda & Von\" (something like that) <br \/> <br \/> I want to find some cute ribbon.. must be real cheap and not in bulk. Any suggestions<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> Colors: Aqua Melon Hot Pink\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/LT1fp9.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/LT1fp9.png<\/a><strong>BarefootBride<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cosey.lewis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1199897905,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208177.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BarefootBride","Id":208177,"Name":"BarefootBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10115,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1035e8f7bdfb25cb970d82365c58d68","RawContent":"They have cheap grossgrain ribbon at Walmart in these colors... its back in the craft\/fabrics area","Attachments":[],"Id":172289,"PostDate":1200770103,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size