0pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Templates and pricing coming up!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1590206,"PostDate":1330923165,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">I put in a bunch of extras for our parents and bridesmaids.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span face=\"\">For my mom and stepdad, MOB hat and totebag and Team Bride shirt for my stepdad (Vistaprint)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00192.JPG\" height=\"393\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747857\/width\/600\/height\/450\" width=\"549\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span face=\"\">For Al\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s mom, Mother of the Groom shirt and Carnival Liberty totebag (Vistaprint)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00193.JPG\" height=\"388\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdesti