l='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"jewelry pouch outer.jpg\" height=\"195\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747868\/width\/600\/height\/225\" width=\"551\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul style=\"list-style-type: circle\"> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Notebooks and monogrammed post-it notes<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Bridesmaids' stuff all together:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"bridesmaids packages.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747871\/width\/600\/height\/237\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Finally ready to start packing the bags!<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00328.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747875\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The Total Package\u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00333.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747877\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <em><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Templates and pricing coming up!<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ericataffs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.11.245.41","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1288624566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":197,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acireta","Id":233628,"Name":"acireta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"517e00ae07b0b3dee4d7db4df6b5245b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Price Breakdown&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Totebags - $2.89&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Keycard\/tip holder and lanyard - $.70&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Sudoku\/word search book - $1&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Dramamine - $1.29&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Advil - $.44&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Band-aids - $1.25&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Neosporin - $.69&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Mints &amp;amp; gum - $.58&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Purell - $.33&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Tissues - $.25&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Shout wipes - $.39&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Mustang soaps - $.40&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Sunscreen - $1.79&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Aloe - $.99&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Chapstick and shrink wrap - $.55&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Flip-flop Playing cards - $.67&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Mini personal fan and batteries - $1.50 &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Star Wars Pez - $1.92&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Starfish wine stopper - $3&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Personalized shotglass - $2.77&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Personalized guitar picks - $.15 (5 picks per bag)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Pashmina - $4.95&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Cosmetics bag - $.50&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Everything from Vistaprint was free&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Not including paper for kit toppers\/folders, ribbon, BM extras and shipping costs, these worked out to $29 per bag, give or take a buck or two for doubling lanyards, soaps and chapsticks in the couples\u00e2\u20ac\u2122 bags. We only had to make 12, so it was perfect for our budget.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;I know I went a bit overboard with the pictures, but this thread has really helped me to get organized. I cannot wait to give these bags to our guests at dinner on the first night of the cruise!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1590209,"PostDate":1330923611,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <u><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Price Breakdown<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Totebags - $2.89<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Keycard\/tip holder and lanyard - $.70<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Sudoku\/word search book - $1<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Dramamine - $1.29<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Advil - $.44<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Band-aids - $1.25<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Neosporin - $.69<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Mints & gum - $.58<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Purell - $.33<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Tissues - $.25<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Shout wipes - $.39<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Mustang soaps - $.40<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Sunscreen - $1.79<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Aloe - $.99<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Chapstick and shrink wrap - $.55<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Flip-flop Playing cards - $.67<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Mini personal fan and batteries - $1.50 <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Star Wars Pez - $1.92<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Starfish wine stopper - $3<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Personalized shotglass - $2.77<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Personalized guitar picks - $.15 (5 picks per bag)<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Pashmina - $4.95<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Cosmetics bag - $.50<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Everything from Vistaprint was free<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Not including paper for kit toppers\/folders, ribbon, BM extras and shipping costs, these worked out to $29 per bag, give or take a buck or two for doubling lanyards, soaps and chapsticks in the couples\u00e2\u20ac\u2122 bags. We only had to make 12, so it was perfect for our budget.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">I know I went a bit overboard with the pictures, but this thread has really helped me to get organized. I cannot wait to give these bags to our guests at dinner on the first night of the cruise!!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ericataffs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.11.245.41","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1288624566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":197,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acireta","Id":233628,"Name":"acireta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98395c91d0c8adf9c3223c72315d02e2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;11543&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;w