{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":107,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":13694,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1734541,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":254217,"Name":"sillafeliz","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254217.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1363443239,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":44,"Preview":{"Id":1734541,"PostDate":1363443239,"PostContent":"Hello Ladies,  \u00a0  So to save some money, my FI and I are planning on labelling our own tumblers....","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"silla.feliz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1334799041,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254217.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sillafeliz","Id":254217,"Name":"sillafeliz","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f89f92cd6c50b298e96198b837272ed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; So to save some money, my FI and I are planning on labelling our own tumblers....&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363439263251_1632\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"193265\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193265\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; here is what we came up with (with ideas of course borrowed from another bride)....&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363439263251_1168\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"194018\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194018\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We went to staples and asked for a waterproof label....the guy gave us one that is partially clear...brought it home, printed them all out....then my beautiful dog drooled on it...guess what! It&#039;s not so waterproof!!! Thankfully they aren&#039;t on the tumblers yet.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We&#039;re looking for other options to personalize them, anyone got any ideas?? Anyone done these before?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks for your help! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1734541,"PostDate":1363443239,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> So to save some money, my FI and I are planning on labelling our own tumblers....<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363439263251_1632\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"193265\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/193265\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> here is what we came up with (with ideas of course borrowed from another bride)....<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363439263251_1168\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"194018\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194018\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We went to staples and asked for a waterproof label....the guy gave us one that is partially clear...brought it home, printed them all out....then my beautiful dog drooled on it...guess what! It's not so waterproof!!! Thankfully they aren't on the tumblers yet.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We're looking for other options to personalize them, anyone got any ideas?? Anyone done these before?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks for your help! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"silla.feliz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1334799041,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254217.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sillafeliz","Id":254217,"Name":"sillafeliz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"887b5ba52d389a9c1213612703ba0c39","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; i&#039;m still contemplating whether or not to do some sort of tumbler or just a koozie (which i think is cheaper &amp;amp; lighter!)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1734907,"PostDate":1363557380,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> i'm still contemplating whether or not to do some sort of tumbler or just a koozie (which i think is cheaper & lighter!)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aleedoc17@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361667075,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266489.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"aleedoc17","Id":266489,"Name":"aleedoc17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d0340e0cf52f4a52c4d32d44eb1bc78","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I ordered waterproof labels from Bridget at Davet Designs. &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"194205\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194205\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1735186,"PostDate":1363630911,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I ordered waterproof labels from Bridget at Davet Designs. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"194205\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194205\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samcleod23@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.136.150.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1340905835,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257242.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SamIAm85","Id":257242,"Name":"SamIAm85","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c93e1d2b2c479dc652d5feb42e4395a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Those are beautiful!! :) I love the saying on yours! :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Etsy dealer - never thought of that!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My WONDERFUL fiance came up with a solution for our tumblers today! :) He went into a sign company today and we&#039;re having them put the labels on the cups for us...and it will probably cost us about the same amount as the stickers off Etsy.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Will post a pic when we get them back! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1735418,"PostDate":1363657634,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Those are beautiful!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I love the saying on yours! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Etsy dealer - never thought of that!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My WONDERFUL fiance came up with a solution for our tumblers today! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> He went into a sign company today and we're having them put the labels on the cups for us...and it will probably cost us about the same amount as the stickers off Etsy.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Will post a pic when we get them back! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"silla.feliz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1334799041,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254217.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sillafeliz","Id":254217,"Name":"sillafeliz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6c63dab27239aa250e0184ae2f280082","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m glad you found a solution!&amp;nbsp; Can&#039;t wait to see the pics!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1735650,"PostDate":1363714229,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm glad you found a solution!\u00a0 Can't wait to see the pics!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samcleod23@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.136.150.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1340905835,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257242.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SamIAm85","Id":257242,"Name":"SamIAm85","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57b3bb150d85873d962d2b63c593a822","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; They should be done by next Wednesday - I&#039;ll post pics ASAP.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also, just wondering if anyone else did this...we decided we wanted to make ourselves some cups too. They&#039;ll be most memorable for us...so we went to buy more, and the dollarama told my FI that they aren&#039;t selling them like that anymore because they break too easily during shipping....SOOOO....I immediately went out and got three extras JUST IN CASE any break on the way down there...we all know our luggage gets tossed around pretty badly. Anyone else get extras?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1736033,"PostDate":1363748324,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> They should be done by next Wednesday - I'll post pics ASAP.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, just wondering if anyone else did this...we decided we wanted to make ourselves some cups too. They'll be most memorable for us...so we went to buy more, and the dollarama told my FI that they aren't selling them like that anymore because they break too easily during shipping....SOOOO....I immediately went out and got three extras JUST IN CASE any break on the way down there...we all know our luggage gets tossed around pretty badly. Anyone else get extras?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"silla.feliz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1334799041,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254217.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sillafeliz","Id":254217,"Name":"sillafeliz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"86ddf41149c2b290627e67a88782497f","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]sillafeliz[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n They should be done by next Wednesday - I&#039;ll post pics ASAP. \n \n Also, just wondering if anyone else did this...we decided we wanted to make ourselves some cups too. They&#039;ll be most memorable for us...so we went to buy more, and the dollarama told my FI that they aren&#039;t selling them like that anymore because they break too easily during shipping....SOOOO....I immediately went out and got three extras JUST IN CASE any break on the way down there...we all know our luggage gets tossed around pretty badly. Anyone else get extras?[\/quote] \n smart idea. i&#039;ll remember that if i do these kinds of cups!","Attachments":[],"Id":1736331,"PostDate":1363806352,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>sillafeliz<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> They should be done by next Wednesday - I'll post pics ASAP.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, just wondering if anyone else did this...we decided we wanted to make ourselves some cups too. They'll be most memorable for us...so we went to buy more, and the dollarama told my FI that they aren't selling them like that anymore because they break too easily during shipping....SOOOO....I immediately went out and got three extras JUST IN CASE any break on the way down there...we all know our luggage gets tossed around pretty badly. Anyone else get extras?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> smart idea. i'll remember that if i do these kinds of cups!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aleedoc17@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361667075,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266489.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"aleedoc17","Id":266489,"Name":"aleedoc17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c7bd8eadf0308c31da65fc44ab0f92a","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]sillafeliz[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n They should be done by next Wednesday - I&#039;ll post pics ASAP. \n \n Also, just wondering if anyone else did this...we decided we wanted to make ourselves some cups too. They&#039;ll be most memorable for us...so we went to buy more, and the dollarama told my FI that they aren&#039;t selling them like that anymore because they break too easily during shipping....SOOOO....I immediately went out and got three extras JUST IN CASE any break on the way down there...we all know our luggage gets tossed around pretty badly. Anyone else get extras?[\/quote] \n I can&#039;t wait to see the pictures on how they came out!","Attachments":[],"Id":1736365,"PostDate":1363811179,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>sillafeliz<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> They should be done by next Wednesday - I'll post pics ASAP.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, just wondering if anyone else did this...we decided we wanted to make ourselves some cups too. They'll be most memorable for us...so we went to buy more, and the dollarama told my FI that they aren't selling them like that anymore because they break too easily during shipping....SOOOO....I immediately went out and got three extras JUST IN CASE any break on the way down there...we all know our luggage gets tossed around pretty badly. Anyone else get extras?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I can't wait to see the pictures on how they came out!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lyna_89_07@mugglenet.com","IpAddress":"172.8.174.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362361091,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lyna89","Id":266841,"Name":"lyna89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"15a760e3a099f7d6b2e304b0829c6939","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow thanks for sharing this, I too am doing the cups, and I appreciate the tip on getting extras just in case!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1737387,"PostDate":1364025870,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow thanks for sharing this, I too am doing the cups, and I appreciate the tip on getting extras just in case!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mscheryl10@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361033849,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266139.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mscheryl10","Id":266139,"Name":"mscheryl10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c311b320601018e6cd9e0130b9e098a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Ladies! Just wanted to share a site that I came across..www.totallyweddingkoozies.com&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;I wanted koozies as a last minute addition to our OOT bags and the majority of the sites have a larger than needed minimum order. I was able to order 25 of them from here and they even threw in a \"bride\" and \"groom\" koozie! They turned out great and were pretty cheap =)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; They actually have a bunch of customizable items if you go to&amp;nbsp;http:\/\/www.totallypromotional.com\/&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1737606,"PostDate":1364099944,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Ladies! Just wanted to share a site that I came across..www.totallyweddingkoozies.com<\/p> <p> \u00a0I wanted koozies as a last minute addition to our OOT bags and the majority of the sites have a larger than needed minimum order. I was able to order 25 of them from here and they even threw in a \"bride\" and \"groom\" koozie! They turned out great and were pretty cheap =)<\/p> <p> They actually have a bunch of customizable items if you go to\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.totallypromotional.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.totallypromotional.com\/<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessicalyts@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1337393368,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255553.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jessica Lynn","Id":255553,"Name":"Jessica Lynn","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"73219","Title":"DIY Tumblers - with pics - share your designs! ","LastPostDate":1435629850},"Pages":{"TotalItems":107,"TotalPages":11,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":100},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
